    "long_instructions": "# Order a Pizza\r\n\r\n1. Create a function called `orderPizza` that takes in two parameters.\r\n2. Build a message using the parameters.\r\n3. Display the message on screen.\r\n\r\n_Challenge: Add another dropdown field to add an additional topping to the pizza._",
